    "description": "The stonehinje is a giant made entirely of stone, with an immense rough body. Its heart is gold, as large as a man's fist and always warm. Its stomach is as hollow as a cave. Some grow as large as mountains, others only as large as ogres. Roughly sculpted, it walks on two legs and can change its mass into a door, wall, chest, or floor.",
